E AX2004 941-removed-linear.ax:1:16-22 removed-construct "`linear` parsed and enforced nothing, and is now refused" #"`linear` was refused rather than implemented: it built the nominal type `Linear T` and enforced nothing else - no use was counted, so a value could be consumed twice or never, and the marker read as an ownership guarantee it did not supply" ?"delete the marker and use the type itself: reclamation is the reference counting every heap block carries, and `__axiom_arena_mark`/`__axiom_arena_reset_keeping` is the explicit fallback for a program that wants to choose the point"
